Z||000001||voyagerspe||05-22-2001||11:59 PM||||cut the rubber lines as close as possible to the fittings then use a propane torch to make the fittings cherry red, use a line wrench and vice grips they will come free.<P>p.s. make sure you cut the rubber lines before you use the torch or the lines will explode and you will get a face full of hot brake fluid.||||reg||1
